meta {
  name: Create Notice
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notices
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "employee_id": 1,
    "reason_id": 1,
    "absence_start_date": "2026-12-01",
    "absence_end_date": "2026-12-01",
    "remarks": "Prueba desde Bruno"
  }
}

docs {
  Requeridos: `employee_id`, `reason_id`, `absence_start_date`, `absence_end_date`. `status` opcional (default `pending`).

  Errores: `422 INVALID_EMPLOYEE` / `INVALID_REASON` / `INVALID_APPROVER` si los ids no existen. La base valida con un CHECK que `absence_end_date >= absence_start_date` (400 generico si se incumple).
}
